-- Dark Chaos - itemdisplayinfo_dbc InventoryIcon_1 backfill (21652 display rows / 7999 distinct icons)
-- Root cause: retail moved the item icon from Item.db2's IconFileDataID (now 0 for
-- everything added from ~11.x on) to ItemAppearance.DefaultIconFileDataID, and
-- downport-item.js only read the former -- so every affected display shipped with an
-- empty icon = a permanent question mark. The binary ItemDisplayInfo.dbc is already
-- repaired; these overlay rows OVERRIDE it at startup, so they need the same values.
-- Scope: display ids >= 60000 only (the downported band). The 1,961 recoverable rows
-- in the stock 3.3.5 band are byte-identical to stock and are left alone on purpose.
-- Idempotent: the `InventoryIcon_1` = '' guard means a re-run is a no-op and an icon
-- set deliberately elsewhere is never overwritten.

